                                "sense_id": "bcf8c4a1-6975-3d98-ac40-c5c1abdf1d71",
                                "text": "Watt saw the little movements of the stuff, the little bulgings and crumplings, and the sudden indrawings, where it was nipped, between forefinger and thumb probably, for those are the nippers."
