                                "sense_id": "0415c16d-0bc9-342a-905a-738398be0f92",
                                "text": "When strata are so unsymmetrically and abundantly folded that it becomes difficult or impossible to trace out the individual flexures and crumplings — the whole forming an irregular complex of folds — they are said to be contorted […]"
